1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,600
这是一段讲空车桩的小动画
This is a short animation about empty bike docks.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,200
它一开始只是一个仪表盘
It started as a dashboard.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,000
今天给大家看两种新的 Artifact
Today I want to show you two new artifact types,

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Claude Dashboards 和 Claude Motion
Claude Dashboards and Claude Motion.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
假设我管一家共享单车的运营团队
Pretend that I run the operations team at a bike share.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
每个工作日，山上的车桩 8:15 就空了
Every weekday, the docks on the hill are empty by 8:15.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,300
我们得查清楚为什么
We need to get to the bottom of it.

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,500
我们让 Claude 从数据仓库拉了一年的骑行数据
We let Claude pull a year of ride data from our data warehouse

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,200
排成一个好看的仪表盘
and lay it out as a nice dashboard.

10
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,000
看着看着，一个故事就出来了
As we look at the dashboard, a story takes shape.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,300
下次全员大会，得把这个故事讲给整个团队听
And we'll need to tell this story to the whole team at our next all-hands meeting

12
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,000
让大家都认同
to get them on board.

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,500
所以我们让 Claude 把仪表盘做成动画
So we asked Claude to turn this dashboard into an animation,

14
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,000
用的是 Claude Motion
using Claude Motion.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,500
Claude 把它变成一段动画叙事
Claude turns it into an animated narrative.

16
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,500
Claude 第一版通常就做得不错
Claude usually does a pretty good job right away,

17
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:59,500
但想改的话，我可以接着留评论去调
but I can continue to tweak it and steer it with comments if I want to,

18
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,000
直接在视频上留
right there on the video.

19
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
发给同事，他们也能留评论
I can send it to colleagues and they can comment too.

20
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:06,500
大家一起把故事做出来
We can build the story together.

21
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:10,500
团队想再加工，可以直接导出到设计工具
And if the team wants to take it further, we can export it straight into their design tools.

22
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,500
这就是 Claude Dashboards 和 Claude Motion
So that's Claude Dashboards and Claude Motion,

23
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,500
今天就能用
and you can try them out today.

